            "accordion_text": "<h6>Koozi Side Table Crate</h6><ul><li>Designed in Sydney, Australia</li><li>Premium and scratch-proof elm wood melamine plywood</li><li>White Carrara marble-textured MDF</li><li>Transparent Acrylic Door</li><li>Gold Brass locks</li></ul><h6>Plush Bed</h6><p><strong>Mattress</strong></p><ul><li>Supportive Orthopaedic Memory Foam base layer with a cooling Gel Memory Foam top layer</li><li>Waterproof inner liner</li></ul><p><strong>Fabric Cover</strong></p><ul><li> Linen Fabric: Linen and performance upholstery polyester blend. 480gsm</li><li>Boucle: Acrylic cotton upholstery blend. 600gsm.</li><li>OEKO-TEX Certified (no nasties)</li></ul><h6>Soft topper</h6><p><strong>Fabric Cover</strong></p><ul><li>55% Linen 45% Cotton</li><li>325gsm heavyweight fabric</li><li>Invisible YKK Zip</li><li>Machine washable</li></ul><p><strong>Inner Materials</strong></p><ul><li>Waterproof / liquid-resistant liner</li><li>Eco-friendly polycluster fibre filling</li></ul>",
