          "settings": {
            "accordion_heading": "Details and Care",
            "heading_style": "font-body",
            "accordion_text": "<h6>Koozi Side Table Crate</h6><ul><li>Simple assembly</li><li>Transparent pocket door</li><li>Elongated horizontal air holes</li><li>Waterproof marble style top</li><li>Scratch-proof interior</li><li>Rubber feet for grip and prevent scratching floors</li><li><strong>Weight: </strong>Small size: 24kg; Medium size: 34kg</li><li><strong>Care: </strong>Use mild spray and wipe or a damp cloth to clean dirt, marks and dust</li></ul><h6>Plush Bed</h6><ul><li>CertiPUR-US certified memory foam</li><li>Upholstery fabric cover</li><li>Waterproof Liner</li><li>Machine washable, zip-removable cover</li><li>Timeless, natural and elegant style</li><li>Hidden YKK zips</li><li>OEKO-TEX Standard 100 certified.</li><li><strong>Care: </strong>Machine wash on a low temperature and gentle cycle. Line dry when possible</li></ul><h6>Soft Topper</h6><ul><li>Waterproof</li><li>Cotton-Linen Blend</li><li>Versatile Use </li><li>Reversible</li><li>Fringed edging</li><li><strong>Care: </strong>Machine wash on a low temperature and gentle cycle. Line dry when possible</li></ul><p></p>",
