            "icon_name": "shield",
            "title": "Premium, Durable Materials",
            "text": "<p>Designed with a timeless, natural aesthetic, the Koozi Side Table Crate features a scratch-resistant melamine-coated elm wood veneer for lasting style and durability. Paired with a low-maintenance, water-resistant marble-look top, it offers both elegance and practicality.</p>"
