            "text": "<p>Our foam is <a href=\"http://www.certipur.us/\" title=\"CertiPUR-US®\">CertiPUR-US®</a> certified, providing orthopaedic support that's just the right balance for smaller dogs. Topped with a cooling gel memory foam, it adds a breathable, contouring layer for ultimate comfort.</p>",
