          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Plush_Flat_Beds_Stacked.jpg",
            "title": "Premium Upholstery Fabric Covers",
            "text": "<p>Choose between a breathable linen-blend or plush boucle fabric cover, both crafted from premium, OEKO-TEX Standard 100 certified materials. The linen collection offers an earthy, breathable palette for a refined, understated look, while the boucle provides a soft, cozy texture that enriches any home decor.</p>",
