          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/red_clay_linen_cover_plush_flat_bed.jpg",
            "title": "Low-Profile Mattress for Smaller Dogs",
            "text": "<p>A low-profile design makes it easy for smaller dogs to hop on and off without straining their legs. Its sleek, supportive mattress ensures optimal comfort without unnecessary height, perfect for stretching out or fitting into compact spaces like crates.</p>",
