    "tabs": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "acordion-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the right size for my dog?",
            "text": "<p>We recommend referring to our size guide at the top of the page, to ensure you choose the right size for your dog.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I assemble the crate?",
            "text": "<p>The Koozi Side Table Crate arrives flat-packed and can be assembled in under 15 minutes with our clear instructions.<br/><br/>For additional assistance, please refer to our assembly videos.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes the Koozi Side Table Crate different to other crates?",
            "text": "<p><strong>Dual Functionality</strong>: Unlike standard crates, the Koozi Side Table Crate serves a dual purpose as a stylish side table and a functional dog den. This allows it to seamlessly blend into your home decor while providing a cosy, safe space for your pet.</p><p><strong>Design Aesthetic</strong>: The Koozi Side Table Crate is designed to be visually appealing, ensuring that it complements your interior design rather than detracting from i, unlike the eyesore of wire crates. This modern approach to pet furniture enhances the overall look of your shared living spaces.</p><p><strong>Versatile Use</strong>: With the option to leave the door open for a safe den or closed for crate training, it offers flexibility in how you use the crate, adapting to your dog's needs.</p><p><strong>Quality Furniture Materials</strong>: Crafted with premium materials, including a durable construction that’s built to last, the Koozi Side Table Crate is both functional and stylish, setting it apart from lower-quality metal alternatives.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d0defd0d-94c3-403c-bd36-dc2f140a104f": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I ask for assistance?",
            "text": "<p>For further assistance, contact our Care team: help@koozipets.com.au.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_NDjbVD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will my order ship?",
            "text": "<p>We ship from our warehouse in Sydney. All orders will be dispatched within 1 to 2 business days.<br/><br/>Orders placed on Saturday or Sunday, will be processed the next business day.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_KhjDzY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the benefits of crate training?",
            "text": "<p>Crate training helps dogs feel secure and comfortable by providing a personal, safe space that reduces anxiety and reinforces routine. Recognising that crate training is a personal choice, our crate features a hidden pocket door system, allowing it to serve as both a cosy den for your dog and a stylish side table for you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_XMYqcW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is this suitable for new puppies?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, the Koozi Side Table Crate is perfect for introducing your puppy to a safe space, with a design that will last a lifetime and complement your home. While the melamine-coated wood is waterproof, we recommend placing a dedicated towel on the base of the crate, beneath the bed, during the toilet training phase for added protection.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_RE78Jj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warranty and Returns",
            "text": "<h6>Warranty Coverage</h6><p>Koozi Pets provides a <strong>12-month limited warranty</strong> covering manufacturing defects only. This warranty applies solely to defects from faulty workmanship.<br/><br/>The warranty period for Side Table Crates purchased from Koozi is one (1) year from the date of purchase. If a replacement Side Table Crates or part is provided, it will inherit the remaining warranty of the original item or one year from the replacement date.</p><p>During the warranty period, Koozi Pets will replace any products or parts of the crate that are proven to be defective due to improper material or workmanship, only. Repairs and/or replacements are provided at no charge to you, for eligible warranty claims.<br/><br/>The warranty does <strong>not</strong> cover:</p><ul><li><strong>Damage caused by improper assembly </strong>or not following the instructions when unpacking.</li><li><strong>Normal wear and tear</strong>, including any dog-related use, washing-related wear, weathering, sun-damage or corrosion.</li><li><strong>Damages due to use by pets</strong> (e.g., chewing, bites, rips, burns, excessive scratching, stains, or moisture/liquid damage).</li><li><strong>Damage from improper weight placement</strong> on the Side Table Crates.</li><li><strong>Scars, marks and colour</strong> that are characteristics of natural materials.</li><li><strong>Damage caused by spills </strong>such as acid, solvents, dyes or other corrosive materials, ink, paint, or bodily fluids.</li><li><strong>Commercial use</strong> damage, such as use in hotels or stores.</li></ul><p><br/>To make a claim please read our policy and steps to submit a claim <a href=\"https://koozipets.com.au/pages/warranty-and-returns\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Warranty & Returns\">here</a>.</p><h6>Returns and Exchanges Policy</h6><p><strong>We do not offer returns or exchanges</strong> on the Side Table Crate, including for change of mind, as it is a<em> large furniture item</em> and cannot be returned once shipped to you. There is no way of you shipping it back to us.<br/><br/>Before purchasing, please ensure the Side Table Crate meets your dog’s size and has that you have an adequate space in your home to fit it.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
