    "section_accordions_ePD3V7": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "text_AN8mGf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I care for my Plush Flat Bed?",
            "text": "<p>Caring for your Plush Flat Bed is simple!</p><ol><li><strong>Cover:</strong> The zip-off cover can be easily removed and machine washed on a cold, gentle cycle with mild detergent. For best results, lay flat to dry.</li><li><strong>Waterproof Liner:</strong> Wipe down the waterproof liner with a spray or soapy water for easy cleaning.</li><li><strong>Foam Core:</strong> If you need to clean the foam, wipe it down with warm, soapy water. Allow it to dry completely in a dry place to ensure all moisture is removed before reassembling the bed.</li></ol><p>By following these care instructions, you can keep your bed looking and feeling fresh!</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_MjaqRn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I assemble the bed?",
            "text": "<p>No assembly is required. Once you unbox your dog's new Plush Flat Bed, it will expand. Your dog can use it immediately, but it may take up to 24 hours for the mattress to completely expand.<br/><br/>Simply slide the Plush Flat Bed into the Side Table Crate to complete the set up.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_TfjFP3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does OEKO-TEX Standard 100 mean?",
            "text": "<p>OEKO-TEX Standard 100 is a certification that ensures our bed covers and foam mattresses are free from harmful substances and chemicals, making them safe for both pets and humans.<br/><br/>This certification guarantees that the fabric meets strict safety and environmental criteria, reflecting our commitment to quality and sustainability. By choosing OEKO-TEX certified covers, you can trust that you are providing a safe, durable, and sustainable option for your dog.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_NXdqg4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warranty and Returns",
            "text": "<h5>Returns and Exchanges</h5><p><strong>For Unopened & Unused Items Only</strong><br/>Unopened and unused beds can be returned within 7 days of receipt for a full refund or exchange. Please ensure you have not cut the vacuum seal. To check the size, carefully open the box and unroll the vacuum-sealed item without breaking the seal. If it’s not the right fit, re-roll the item, place it back in the box, and return it.</p><p>You are responsible for the cost and arrangement of return shipping.<br/><br/>Please be aware that opened beds (i.e., those with a cut vacuum seal) cannot be returned or exchanged due to handling difficulties and hygiene concerns.<br/></p><h5>Warranty</h5><p>We offer a 12-month warranty covering manufacturing defects, including faulty workmanship or materials. This warranty does not cover normal wear and tear or damages caused by dog use, such as excessive scratching, biting, accidents, chewing, or other use.</p><p>For warranty issues, please contact us within 48 hours of opening the bed at <a>hello@koozipets.com.au</a>, including images of the defective or damaged item. Failure to provide this information within the specified timeframe may void your exchange or refund.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_AN8mGf",
        "text_MjaqRn",
        "text_TfjFP3",
        "text_NXdqg4"
      ],
