    "section_accordions_WbCTbB": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "text_QfxEbB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is the Sofa Topper different from a regular blanket?",
            "text": "<p>Unlike regular blankets, the Koozi Sofa Topper is designed with a water-resistant liner and filling to guard against pet accidents, spills, pet hair, and scratches. This helps extend the life of your sofa, saving you from frequent cleaning or costly replacements.</p><p>Made from a natural, breathable linen-cotton blend, the topper offers added comfort, particularly in warm months when synthetic covers can cause overheating—keeping your pet cool and comfortable instead. The natural fibers are also low-static, so pet hair clings less and is easy to clean.</p><p>The premium fabric cover enhances your furniture without fully covering it, making it a stylish, functional addition that integrates seamlessly into your space. So, you’re not just buying a cover; you’re investing in a versatile, cosy piece that complements your decor while providing essential protection.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_epie3Y": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warranty and Returns",
            "text": "<h5>Returns and Exchanges</h5><p><strong>For Unopened & Unused Items Only</strong><br/>Unopened and unused Sofa Toppers can be returned within 7 days of receipt for a full refund or exchange. Please ensure you have not cut the vacuum seal. To check the size, carefully open the box and unroll the vacuum-sealed item without breaking the seal. If it’s not the right fit, re-roll the item, place it back in the box, and return it.</p><p>You are responsible for the cost and arrangement of return shipping.<br/><br/>Please be aware that opened Sofa Toppers (i.e., those with a cut vacuum seal) cannot be returned or exchanged due to handling difficulties and hygiene concerns.<br/></p><h5>Warranty</h5><p>We offer a 12-month warranty covering manufacturing defects, including faulty workmanship or materials. This warranty does not cover normal wear and tear or damages caused by dog use, such as excessive scratching, biting, accidents, chewing, or other use.</p><p>For warranty issues, please contact us within 48 hours of opening the bed at <a>hello@koozipets.com.au</a>, including images of the defective or damaged item. Failure to provide this information within the specified timeframe may void your exchange or refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_rxmmFJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I determine what size to choose?",
            "text": "<p>When deciding on the right Sofa Topper size, think about both coverage and placement. Here are some tips to help guide you:</p><ol><li><strong>Assess Your Furniture's Seating Area</strong>: Measure the seating width of your sofa or chair. This helps ensure the topper drapes nicely without excess material hanging over the edges.</li><li><strong>Consider Desired Coverage</strong>:<br/><strong>For Sofas</strong>: Decide if you want the topper to cover just the seating area or extend over the armrests for added protection. The standard size works well for most 2-3 seater sofas, while the large size offers more coverage on 3-4 seater sofas.<br/><strong>For Chairs or Beds</strong>: If you’re planning to use the topper on a single chair, the standard size is ideal. For use at the end of a bed or for extra surface area, the large size offers additional flexibility.</li><li><strong>Versatility in Use</strong>: If you’d like the option to use the topper across various spots (like the car, bed, or armchair), the standard size is easier to manage and transport, while the large size provides more protection on bigger surfaces.</li></ol>"
          }
        },
        "text_KDJJQx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What other Koozi products pair well with the Sofa Topper?",
            "text": "<p>The Sofa Topper pairs beautifully with our Cloud Bed and Plush Bed in linen fabric, creating a unified, pet-friendly look for your home. </p><p>With matching natural tones and textures, these pieces enhance your interiors while offering comfort, style, and protection. This cohesive setup keeps your space looking polished and pet-ready without compromising on aesthetics.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
